WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:14.221
This is Mascot AI, your AI college counselor. Meet Maya, a junior who wants to study computer science. This is her dashboard: how far along her profile is, her matches, her essays, and what is coming up.

2
00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:31.594
Maya builds her profile by talking. Instead of filling out forms, she has a voice conversation with Mascot about her activities, what she is proud of, and what she wants from college. Mascot listens, takes notes, and turns the conversation into a story she can write from.

3
00:00:32.295 --> 00:00:41.636
Her profile fills in as she talks: grades, test scores, activities, honors, and the story behind them. She can edit any of it at any time.

4
00:00:42.339 --> 00:00:52.023
From that profile, Mascot builds a college list and sorts it into reach, target and safety. Every school comes with the reasons it fits and an estimate of her chances.

5
00:00:52.728 --> 00:00:58.926
She can also search thousands of schools. Saving a school is always free, and saved schools feed her planner.

6
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:08.646
Her essays live here. Mascot suggests what to write about, checks a draft against the school it is for, and flags grammar. It never writes the essay for her.

7
00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:14.877
The planner keeps every deadline in one place: supplements, test dates and scholarships.

8
00:01:15.578 --> 00:01:24.944
If Maya works with a private counselor, she links with them here and chooses exactly what they can see. She can change that, or end the link, whenever she wants.

9
00:01:25.648 --> 00:01:30.090
Writing is always free. Start with the free plan at mascot-ai.com.
